    "q-129354": {
      "dom_id": "step-q129354",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Let $A=BC.$ What is the value of ${a}_{22}$, if\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 5 & -2\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $B$ by the $2$nd column in $C$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{22} & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =5\\cdot 3+(-2)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =15-2 \\\\  & =13.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
